  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Julien-cpsn/ATAC/tarball/v0.24.0",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Julien-cpsn/ATAC/zipball/v0.24.0",
  "body": "Hello, this update has been possible mainly thanks to the huge work of @helenkwok !!!\r\nI have some ideas of new features in mind\r\n\r\n## Added\r\n\r\n- 🦟 | **Added MQTT requests** @helenkwok \r\n  - <img width=\"1080\" height=\"590\" alt=\"mqtt\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/51af9e7d-05bd-459f-9738-545fcbf785c6\" />\r\n  - Supports MQTT v3.1.1, v5, clean sessions, client IDs, QoS, many topic subscriptions and many more!!\r\n  - You need to add the new MQTT section to your theme files (you can straight copy the websocket section). E.g.:\r\n```toml\r\n[MQTT]\r\n    [MQTT.connection_status]\r\n    connected = \"Green\"\r\n    disconnected = \"Red\"\r\n\r\n    [MQTT.messages]\r\n    server_foreground_color = \"Blue\"\r\n    server_background_color = \"DarkGray\"\r\n    you_background_color = \"DarkGray\"\r\n    details_color = \"DarkGray\"\r\n```\r\n- 🔎 | **Added QUERY HTTP method** @eshad \r\n  - You need to add the new QUERY HTTP method entry to your theme files. E.g.:\r\n```toml\r\n[HTTP]\r\n    [HTTP.methods]\r\n    GET = \"Green\"\r\n    POST = \"Yellow\"\r\n    QUERY = \"LightMagenta\"\r\n    ...\r\n```\r\n## Improved\r\n\r\n- Updated dependencies\r\n",
